issouri/wayne-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Wayne County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the grids February to March and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025, July to August came in at 44% of normal and November to December at 42% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 22% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid in the table had its driest year in 1953.</p>"}
